+//
+// The memory card (CONFIG_VMU): the adapter holds it in RAM and the PSP keeps
+// it as a file; the exchange is described in the protocol header. What the
+// adapter holds outlives a PSP that is unplugged or restarted (card_loaded is
+// not the device's state but the adapter's), so a save made meanwhile reaches
